\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclusion}

We described how we tackled the problem of summarising long text documents in a single, coherent sentence, within a contest-driven scenario.  To our knowledge, this is the first work on single-sentence summarisation, especially with long documents.  We also presented the summary quality of our final submission and contrasted it with the official summary of the event.  We believe we were able to produce an acceptable summary which highlighted the key facts of the event.
